{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 111, :comments ["<b>נחלתי</b> — The meaning is: נחלתי, that I may rejoice in it." "<b>ועדותיך</b> — They are the wonders that You performed, which my ancestors transmitted, and I rejoice as though I had been a witness in those days."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 119, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:43.585941147Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}